## Schéma Relationnel de la Base de Données

| Entité | Table | Clés Primaires | Clés Étrangères | Relations |
|--------|-------|---------------|---------------|-------------|
| **Users** | users | user_id | user_id, role_id | 1-N |
| **Roles** | roles | role_id | role_id, user_id | 1-N |
| **Departments** | departments | department_id | department_id, user_id | 1-N |
| **Employees** | employees | employee_id | employee_id, department_id | 1-N |
| **Suppliers** | suppliers | supplier_id | supplier_id, user_id | 1-N |
| **Products** | products | product_id | product_id, supplier_id | 1-N |
| **Orders** | orders | order_id | order_id, employee_id | 1-N |
| **Order_Items** | order_items | order_item_id | order_item_id, order_id | 1-N |
| **Inventory** | inventory | inventory_id | inventory_id, product_id | 1-N |
| **GPS_Tracking** | gps_tracking | tracking_id | tracking_id, order_id | 1-N |

## Architecture Backend & APIs

### Grande Famille d'APIs

- **RESTful API**: 
  - **Endpoints**: /users, /roles, /departments, /employees, /suppliers, /products, /orders, /order_items, /inventory, /gps_tracking
  - **Methods**: GET, POST, PUT, DELETE

- **GraphQL API**:
  - **Endpoints**: /graphql
  - **Methods**: Query, Mutation

### Contrôleurs et Services

- **Contrôleurs**:
  - **/users**: UserController, UserRolesController
  - **/roles**: RoleController, RoleUsersController
  - **/departments**: DepartmentController, DepartmentEmployeesController
  - **/employees**: EmployeeController, EmployeeDepartmentsController
  - **/suppliers**: SupplierController, SupplierEmployeesController
  - **/products**: ProductController, ProductSuppliersController
  - **/orders**: OrderController, OrderEmployeesController
  - **/order_items**: OrderItemController, OrderItemOrdersController
  - **/inventory**: InventoryController, InventoryProductsController
  - **/gps_tracking**: TrackingController, TrackingOrdersController

- **Services**:
  - **/users**: UserService, UserRolesService, UserRolesRepository
  - **/roles**: RoleService, RoleUsersService, RoleUsersRepository
  - **/departments**: DepartmentService, DepartmentEmployeesService, DepartmentEmployeesRepository
  - **/employees**: EmployeeService, EmployeeDepartmentsService, EmployeeDepartmentsRepository
  - **/suppliers**: SupplierService, SupplierEmployeesService, SupplierEmployeesRepository
  - **/products**: ProductService, ProductSuppliersService, ProductSuppliersRepository
  - **/orders**: OrderService, OrderEmployeesService, OrderEmployeesRepository
  - **/order_items**: OrderItemService, OrderItemOrdersService, OrderItemOrdersRepository
  - **/inventory**: InventoryService, InventoryProductsService, InventoryProductsRepository
  - **/gps_tracking**: TrackingService, TrackingOrdersService, TrackingOrdersRepository

